[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0072","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0189","title":"LocalWEB2000 HTTP服务器 目录遍历漏洞","description":"LocalWEB2000 HTTP 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在 HTTP GET 请求中注入 \"..\"（点线）路径遍历序列，绕过服务器对 Web 根目录的访问限制，进而读取目标系统上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 LocalWEB2000 1.1 版本，攻击者仅需向服务器发送特制的包含目录跳转序列的 HTTP 请求即可触发，无需任何凭据或特殊配置，可能导致敏感配置文件、密码文件等系统文件泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0189"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:50Z","remediation":"鉴于 LocalWEB2000 1.1 已是一款过时且厂商已停止维护的 HTTP 服务器，建议立即升级到受支持的 HTTP 服务器（如 IIS、Apache 或 Nginx）。如短期内无法替换，应在防火墙或反向代理层面配置规则，拦截含有 \"..\" 或 URL 编码 \"%2e%2e\" 的 HTTP GET 请求，并严格限制 Web 根目录外的文件访问权限。同时建议在服务器上部署 Web 应用防火墙（WAF），启用目录穿越攻击检测规则，实时监控并阻断异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0346.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2268","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5982","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20585","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0189.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0189.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0189","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0189.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0189.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0189.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2001/CVE-2001-0189.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0189.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0189.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0189.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0071","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0187","title":"WU-FTPD wu-ftp 调试模式格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WU-FTPD 2.6.1 及更早版本在调试模式启用时存在格式字符串漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标 FTP 服务发送包含特制格式字符串的畸形参数，该参数会被记录于 PASV 端口赋值过程中，攻击者借此执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 WU-FTPD 2.4.2、2.5、2.6 等多个版本，攻击条件仅为目标 FTP 服务可达且调试模式开启，无需任何身份凭据即可完成利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0187"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:50Z","remediation":"建议立即将 WU-FTPD 升级至 2.6.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复此格式字符串漏洞。如无法立即升级，可从 ftp://ftp.wu-ftpd.org/pub/wu-ftpd/patches/apply_to_current/missing_format_strings.patch 下载并应用官方补丁。同时，编辑 /etc/inetd.conf，移除 ftpd 启动参数中的 -v 或 -d 调试选项以禁用调试模式，执行 killall -HUP inetd 重启服务。临时缓解措施还包括在防火墙层面限制 FTP 服务仅允许可信来源 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000443","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-016","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2296","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6020","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20594","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0187.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0187","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0187.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0187.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ccbb22644b8f8cd8300036a10ac1ec6d68c2d1a3/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0187.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0187.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/578e3191a13a48b3de7e4ff1967f7100da5c1b72/2001/CVE-2001-0187.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0187.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0187.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2001-0187.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0070","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0184","title":"eEye Iris 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"eEye Iris 1.01 beta 网络监控工具存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可构造特制的畸形数据包发送至目标网络，当用户使用 eEye Iris 查看该恶意数据包时，程序因未对异常数据包进行充分校验而触发崩溃，导致网络监控服务中断，影响网络安全审计与入侵检测工作的正常开展。该漏洞利用条件要求攻击者已处于目标网络环境中并能够发送特制数据包，且用户使用存在缺陷的 Iris 版本进行数据包查看，攻击无需身份认证即可实现服务拒绝，CVSS 评分为 2.6，危害等级较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0184"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:50Z","remediation":"eEye Digital Security 已发布安全公告并修复该漏洞，受影响版本为 Iris 1.01 beta。建议立即将 Iris 网络流量分析器从 1.01 beta 升级至 eEye 官方发布的最新稳定版本（1.01 正式版或更高版本），新版本已修复对畸形数据包头部字段的解析缺陷。如暂时无法升级，应在边界防火墙或 IDS/IPS 设备上部署规则，过滤包含异常 IP/TCP 头部字段（如 ip_v、ip_hl 字段值为 -1）的恶意数据包，阻止其到达运行 Iris 的主机，作为临时缓解措施。同时限制对运行 Iris 主机的远程访问，仅允许受信任的管理源 IP 访问相关端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0343.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0352.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2278","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5981","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20589","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0184.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0184.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0184","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0184.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0184.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/092113bf9ab92144574ec15fc26608ac15913e5a/2001/CVE-2001-0184.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0184.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6450d916b228b26926c778e450e50985a2beb640/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0184.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0184.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0184.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0070.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0069","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0183","title":"FreeBSD ipfw 访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统中 ipfw 和 ip6fw 防火墙规则引擎存在过滤逃避漏洞，其 TCP 连接状态跟踪机制错误地将设置了 ECE（ECN Echo）标志的 TCP 数据包识别为已建立连接的一部分，而无需经过正常的握手流程。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送带有 ECE 标志的特制 TCP 数据包，使恶意流量绕过基于连接状态的访问控制列表（ACL），从而访问本应被防火墙规则阻止的网络服务或主机。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 3.x 和 4.x（含 4.2 及更早版本），攻击者无需持有有效账户或经过身份验证即可在远程发起利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露、服务横向移动或未授权访问，CVSS v2 评分 7.5，危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0183"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:49Z","remediation":"立即升级 FreeBSD 系统到 4.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ipfw/ip6fw 对 TCP ECE 标志的错误处理逻辑。如无法立即升级，可从 ftp://ftp.FreeBSD.org/pub/FreeBSD/CERT/patches/SA-01:08/ 下载对应补丁，以 root 身份执行 patch 命令后重新编译安装 ipfw/ip6fw 内核模块或内核，最后重启系统使修复生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-029.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1743","http://www.security-express.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0424.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2293","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5998","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20593","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0183.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0183","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0183.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0183.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2001/CVE-2001-0183.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6450d916b228b26926c778e450e50985a2beb640/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0183.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0183.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0183.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0183.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2001-0183.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0068","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0177","title":"WebMaster ConferenceRoom 1.8.1 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WebMaster ConferenceRoom 1.8.1 存在一处拒绝服务（Denial of Service，DoS）漏洞。攻击者可以利用 IRC 服务器与服务器克隆（克隆实体）之间的好友关系（Buddy Relationship）机制，向目标服务器发送特制的数据包，触发该漏洞导致服务崩溃或进入异常状态，进而造成目标系统不可正常响应。鉴于该漏洞利用难度不高且可通过网络远程触发，攻击条件相对简单，主要影响使用 WebMaster ConferenceRoom 1.8.1 及 1.8 开发者版本搭建的在线会议服务，威胁其可用性。由于此类会议服务常面向公网开放，远程攻击者无需认证即可发起攻击，可能造成服务中断，影响正常用户会话。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0177"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:49Z","remediation":"建议升级到 ConferenceRoom 1.8.1 之后发布的修复版本（如 1.8.2 及以上），若官方已停止维护则停止该服务的对外暴露。可操作的临时缓解措施：在防火墙或网关层面限制来自不可信来源对该 IRC 服务端口（默认 6667 及监听端口）的连接访问，或仅允许受信任 IP 白名单访问，以阻断远程攻击者建立 buddy 关系从而触发拒绝服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/155388","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2178","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5909","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20534","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0177.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0177.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0177","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0177.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0177.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0177.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2001/CVE-2001-0177.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0177.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0177.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0177.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0066","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0172","title":"SuSE Linux ReiserFS 3.5.28 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0172是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0172"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:48Z","remediation":"升级 SuSE Linux 7.0 的内核包至修复了 ReiserFS 缓冲区溢出问题的版本（如 SuSE-SA:2001:006 公告对应的内核更新包），或手动应用 reiserfs 模块补丁以修复长目录名处理时的栈缓冲区溢出。如无法立即升级，可临时通过 umount 卸载所有 ReiserFS 分区并挂载为只读，防止本地用户利用长目录名触发内核崩溃或代码执行；同时限制本地用户对 ReiserFS 文件系统的写入权限，仅允许受信任账户创建目录，并在 /etc/fstab 中将 reiserfs 分区挂载选项加上 nosuid 和 nodev 以降低提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0127.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2180","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5910","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20535","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0172.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0172.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0172","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0172.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0172.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/726a223a23a749274833ae3776326ca97dd305d1/2001/CVE-2001-0172.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0172.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0172.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0172.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0172.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0064","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0170","title":"GNU glibc 环境变量信息泄露漏洞","description":"glibc 2.1.9x 及更早版本在执行 setuid/setgid 程序时，未能正确清除 RESOLV_HOST_CONF、HOSTALIASES 或 RES_OPTIONS 等环境变量，导致本地低权限用户可借助这些残留变量操控 DNS 解析器的配置行为，从而读取系统上的任意文件内容或触发命令执行。该漏洞影响使用了受影响 glibc 版本的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地登录权限，无需身份认证即可利用。由于漏洞仅影响机密性（C:P），CVSS v2 评分为 2.1，危害等级较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0170"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:48Z","remediation":"升级 glibc 至 2.2 或更高版本（如 glibc 2.2.5 及以上），该版本已修复 RESOLV_HOST_CONF/HOSTALIASES/RES_OPTIONS 环境变量在 setuid/setgid 程序中的未清理问题。临时缓解：在 /etc/profile 或用户 shell 配置中显式取消设置上述三个环境变量（unset RESOLV_HOST_CONF HOSTALIASES RES_OPTIONS），并限制普通用户对 setuid 程序的执行权限（chmod o-x /path/to/suid-binary）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0131.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0186.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-001.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2181","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5907","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/317","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0170.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0170","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0170.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0170.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a121c9678feb15c776e19eb9a2198be3c8093209/2001/CVE-2001-0170.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0170.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0170.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0170.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0170.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2001-0170.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0064.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0064.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0063","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0169","title":"GNU glibc LD_PRELOAD 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"` tags.<value>GNU C 库（glibc）2.1.3 版本在处理 LD_PRELOAD 环境变量时存在权限验证缺陷。当 SUID 或 SGID 程序运行时，glibc 未对 /etc/ld.so.cache 中预加载的共享库进行 SUID/SGID 权限校验，导致本地攻击者可利用该漏洞加载非特权库文件，进而覆盖任意系统文件，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响配置了 SUID/SGID 的应用程序，攻击者需具备本地登录权限，通过设置 LD_PRELOAD 指向恶意共享库即可触发。攻击者可借此获取更高权限，对系统机密性与完整性造成威胁。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0169"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:48Z","remediation":"升级 glibc 至 2.1.4 或更高版本以修复 LD_PRELOAD 权限验证缺陷。临时缓解措施包括：清理 /etc/ld.so.cache 中非 SUID/SGID 的库条目，限制本地用户对该文件及 /lib、/usr/lib 目录的写权限，并在安全策略中禁用 SUID/SGID 程序对 LD_PRELOAD 环境变量的继承。确保系统及时应用厂商安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/turbolinux/2001-q1/0004.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-007.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-039","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-012.php3?dis=7.2","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_001_glibc_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-002.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/157650","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2223","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5971","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/290","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0169.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0169","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0169.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ce2c8661ffd3fb6a28ed59c3d877961640a570d4/2001/CVE-2001-0169.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0169.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0169.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0169.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0169.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0169.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0169.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0379","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0379.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1230","title":"Icecast Icecast 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务代码执行漏洞","description":"Icecast 1.3.10 及之前版本存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过发送特制的网络数据包触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝（崩溃）或执行任意代码。该漏洞源于 Icecast 对用户输入缺乏边界检查，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可导致服务器完全受控，影响服务的机密性、完整性和可用性，CVSS 评分 7.5（HIGH）。受影响版本为 Icecast 1.3.10 及之前版本，建议升级至 1.3.10 或更高版本修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1230"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-13T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:51Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Icecast 2.x 或更高版本（当前支持的安全分支）。如果无法立即升级，可在防火墙上限制对 Icecast 端口的访问，并禁用匿名或未认证的流发布功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98455723123298&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-089","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-063.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1230.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1230","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1230.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1230.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/icecast_rbof.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fchq-jwhc-r9q2/GHSA-fchq-jwhc-r9q2.json","https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-ports/blob/58376fbc0dd642d78dda39e7bbfa81a124730b7d/security/vuxml/vuln/2004.xml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1230.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-089.nasl","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2004/FreeBSD-2004-0016.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0379.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0050","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0122","title":"IBM WebSphere Application Server Fast Response Cache Accelerator AfpaCache 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IBM HTTP Server 1.3.x 及 WebSphere Application Server 3.52 中的 Fast Response Cache Accelerator (FRCA) 组件 AfpaCache 模块存在内核信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送一系列特制的畸形 HTTP 请求，触发服务器返回 \"bad request\" 错误，导致内核内存泄露，最终造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可发起，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。该漏洞影响 IBM HTTP Server 1.3.x 及 WebSphere Application Server 3.52 版本，目前已有公开的 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0122"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-13T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:41Z","remediation":"IBM 已发布安全公告指出该漏洞影响 IBM HTTP Server 1.3.x 及 WebSphere 3.52，建议升级至 IBM HTTP Server 2.0 以上版本或 WebSphere 4.0 以上版本，并在反向代理配置中禁用 FRCA/AfpaCache 模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0079.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0061.html","http://www-4.ibm.com/software/webservers/security.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2175","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5900","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20531","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0122.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0122.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0122.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0122","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0122.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0122.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0122.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0122.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2001/CVE-2001-0122.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0122.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0806","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0806.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0134","title":"Compaq Insight Manager 管理代理 cpqlogin.htm 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Compaq Insight Manager 及 Management Agents 等管理软件中的 web-enabled agents 组件所包含的 cpqlogin.htm 页面存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向该页面提交超长用户名参数即可触发缓冲区溢出，进而导致任意代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，影响大量 Compaq 服务器管理平台。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0134"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:44Z","remediation":"立即安装 Compaq（现 HP）官方补丁，补丁下载地址见 Compaq 安全公告 http://www5.compaq.com/products/servers/management/agentsecurity.html。该漏洞影响 Compaq Management Agents 4.70 及更早版本，升级到已修复版本即可消除风险。如无法立即打补丁，在防火墙层面阻止对 TCP 端口 2301 的外部访问，仅允许受信任管理网段连接，作为临时缓解措施。该产品已停止支持，建议迁移到 HP 当前支持的服务器管理平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97967435023835&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2200","http://www5.compaq.com/products/servers/management/agentsecurity.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0134.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0134.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2001/CVE-2001-0134.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2001/CVE-2001-0134.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0134","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0134.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0134.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0134.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0134.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0134.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0806.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0806.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0806.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0800","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0800.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0133","title":"趋势科技 Interscan VirusWall 弱管理员密码保护漏洞","description":"Trend Micro Interscan VirusWall 3.6.x及更早版本的Web管理接口未对通信内容进行加密保护。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络嗅探手段截获管理员提交的HTTP GET请求，或直接访问setpasswd.cgi等管理程序，从中提取base64编码的用户名和密码凭据，进而获取系统管理员权限。该漏洞影响所有部署了受影响版本Interscan VirusWall的邮件安全网关设备，攻击者无需任何前置认证即可远程利用，导致系统完全被接管并可能进一步渗透内部网络。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0133"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:44Z","remediation":"Trend Micro 确认 Interscan VirusWall 3.6.x 及更早版本无法通过补丁修复此漏洞，建议立即升级到 3.7.x 或更高版本，新版已对 Web 管理接口启用 HTTPS 加密传输。如暂无法升级，应在防火墙层面仅允许受信任的 IP 地址访问管理端口 1812，或仅在本地主机使用浏览器配置工具，避免远程通过 HTTP 协议传输管理员凭证。同时建议修改默认管理员密码为高强度密码，并定期审计 /tmp 目录下可疑的临时文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0235.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2212","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0133.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0133.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0133","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0133.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0133.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0133.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/045dd815c5c9edb2f848de9196b8b22db27288ca/2001/CVE-2001-0133.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0133.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0133.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0133.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0800.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0800.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0777","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0777.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0130","title":"IBM Lotus Domino R5 服务器和客户端 HTML 解析器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM Lotus Domino R5 服务器（5.06 之前版本）与 Domino Client（5.05 之前版本）的 HTML 解析器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标 Domino 服务发送包含畸形字体大小（font size）声明指令的特制 HTML 内容触发该溢出，导致堆栈数据被覆盖，从而造成服务拒绝（Denial of Service）并在特定条件下可能执行任意命令。该漏洞影响范围为使用 Lotus Domino R5 系列的企业邮件与协作平台，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可在远程网络位置发起利用，攻击复杂度低。由于 CVSS v2 评分达 10.0（完全机密性、完整性及可用性影响），危害等级极为严重。受影响用户应升级至 Domino Server 5.06 及 Domino Client 5.05 或更高版本以消除此风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0130"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:42Z","remediation":"立即将 Lotus Domino Server 升级至 5.06 或更高版本，Domino Client 升级至 5.05 或更高版本，以修复 HTML 解析器中因畸形字体大小说明符导致的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在邮件路由器上配置规则拦截包含异常 FONT 标签的入站邮件，同时限制 Domino 服务的网络暴露范围，仅允许可信来源访问 HTTP 和 SMTP 端口，并持续关注 IBM/Lotus 官方安全公告获取后续补丁更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service1.symantec.com/sarc/sarc.nsf/info/html/Lotus.Domino.Denial.of.Service.Malformed.HTML.Email.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6207","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0130.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0130.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0130","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0130.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0130.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c9ca0c7ecb65f7366b1a83938dcd1c80cf9c2d0e/2001/CVE-2001-0130.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0130.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0130.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0130.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0130.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0777.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0709","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0709.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0127","title":"Olivier Debon Flash 插件 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Olivier Debon Flash 插件（非 Macromedia 官方插件）中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长 DefineSound 标签的特制 SWF 文件触发该漏洞，导致插件崩溃（拒绝服务），并可能利用溢出实现任意代码执行。攻击者需要诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开恶意文件，攻击复杂度较高，但成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0127"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:42Z","remediation":"立即卸载 Olivier Debon Flash 插件，该插件已停止维护且无安全更新。改用官方 Adobe Flash Player（已于 2020 年底停止支持），或直接移除所有 Flash 依赖，迁移至 HTML5 标准。在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件加载，并在 Web 服务器配置中拦截 .swf 文件请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0236.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/451096","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2214","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0127.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0127.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0127","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0127.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0127.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/24bf8ab9ac19d70e8e7ca347101f59bbc2694f11/2001/CVE-2001-0127.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0127.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0127.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0127.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0127.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0709.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0708","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0708.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0113","title":"Omnicron OmniHTTPd 2.07 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"OmniHTTPd 2.07 的 statsconfig.pl 脚本存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过构造恶意的 mostbrowsers 参数，该参数值被直接拼接到动态生成的 Perl 脚本中执行，导致任意命令执行。攻击者可利用此漏洞完全控制目标服务器，获取系统最高权限，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。受影响的 OmniHTTPd 2.07 版本未对该参数进行任何过滤或转义处理，攻击者只需向目标服务器的 statsconfig.pl 发送特制 HTTP 请求即可触发。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0113"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:40Z","remediation":"tags.<value>OmniHTTPd 已停止维护多年，官方未发布修复此漏洞的补丁。建议立即迁移至现代 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx），停止使用 OmniHTTPd 2.0.7 及更早版本。若暂时无法迁移，应在防火墙层面限制对 statsconfig.pl 脚本的远程访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接 80 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0248.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2211","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0113.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0113.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0113","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0113.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0113.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0113.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc250cf8fdc59c77fa474d34589422db608209f4/2001/CVE-2001-0113.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0113.md","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-2001-0113.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0113.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0708.toml"}]